# Illustrative soft rules; weights are not estimated from Afghan data.
5: AwarePrev(P) -> Aware(P) ^2
4: SharePrev(P) & Contact(P,Q) & Trust(Q,P) -> Aware(Q) ^2
1: !Aware(P) ^2
4: Aware(P) & Need(P) -> Intent(P) ^2
2: Need(P) -> Intent(P) ^2
3: !Safety(P) -> !Intent(P) ^2
1: !Intent(P) ^2
3: Aware(P) & Reach(P) -> ShareNow(P) ^2
1: !ShareNow(P) ^2
4: Intent(P) & Access(P) & !ServedPrev(P) -> Travel(P) ^2
1: !Travel(P) ^2
5: AtAid(P) & Need(P) & !ServedPrev(P) -> ReceiveNow(P) ^2
1: !ReceiveNow(P) ^2
# Hard PSL constraints.
ServedPrev(P) -> !Travel(P) .
ServedPrev(P) -> !ReceiveNow(P) .
!AtAid(P) -> !ReceiveNow(P) .
!Aware(P) -> !ShareNow(P) .
